    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/c848a269f56e2098350c5d472adbadff.avif?t=1753193295\" width=800 height=299 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NONEWORLD</strong> is a captivating RPG adventure set in strange universe caught in the grasps of destruction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a lost Princess from another world, you awaken in a strange, forgotten kingdom once full of life; now only a fading memory.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with new allies, fight horrifying foes and destroy<i> a lot </i>of farmland in your journey to return home. But be warned: what seems cute at first may soon take a darker turn.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/c0fa59e1a65f7396bab0a41f8c6bc3d0.avif?t=1753193295\" width=800 height=299 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a <i>haunting, hand-drawn</i> world with a captivating narrative and abstract characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through <i>THREE</i> immersive story chapters, each packed with unique gameplay elements; every Chapter requiring roughly an hour or more to complete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a unique <i>turn-based battle system</i>, featuring nearly 100 powerful abilities and monsters straight out of your sleep paralysis episodes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the <i>PRINCESS</i>, fight alongside three vibrant, fruity-colored protagonists; each with a distinct, lovable personality that adds flair to your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <i>open environments</i>, complete narrative quests and gather rare items to forge powerful equipment sets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 ...What's not to love?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/cf7d7e0d892d0551c012934525d416e6.avif?t=1753193295\" width=800 height=299 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/c848a269f56e2098350c5d472adbadff.avif?t=1753193295\" width=800 height=299 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NONEWORLD</strong> is a captivating RPG adventure set in strange universe caught in the grasps of destruction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a lost Princess from another world, you awaken in a strange, forgotten kingdom once full of life; now only a fading memory.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with new allies, fight horrifying foes and destroy<i> a lot </i>of farmland in your journey to return home. But be warned: what seems cute at first may soon take a darker turn.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/c0fa59e1a65f7396bab0a41f8c6bc3d0.avif?t=1753193295\" width=800 height=299 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a <i>haunting, hand-drawn</i> world with a captivating narrative and abstract characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through <i>THREE</i> immersive story chapters, each packed with unique gameplay elements; every Chapter requiring roughly an hour or more to complete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a unique <i>turn-based battle system</i>, featuring nearly 100 powerful abilities and monsters straight out of your sleep paralysis episodes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the <i>PRINCESS</i>, fight alongside three vibrant, fruity-colored protagonists; each with a distinct, lovable personality that adds flair to your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <i>open environments</i>, complete narrative quests and gather rare items to forge powerful equipment sets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 ...What's not to love?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/cf7d7e0d892d0551c012934525d416e6.avif?t=1753193295\" width=800 height=299 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "NONEWORLD is a cute and sometimes scary RPG set in a dying world. You are a lost Princess from another world, accompanied by an omnipresent cheshire cat. Only YOU and your fruity colored allies can LIGHT THE WORLD and return home safely.",
